{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_1","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"cd /home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/runs/2026-10-07_16-54-34-swiftpaxos_epaxos-real-run/draft && /home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/.venv/bin/python - <<'PY'\nimport json\nsub={\\\"action\\\":\\\"review\\\",\n \\\"rationale\\\":\\\"Resolution of the open scope issue ef6b54abce294555b31a3c9a6ca606ac on artifact 05dc6a3632954371911663108e7e18e8, now that the challenged component has actually changed: the accepted F2 amended claim C1's scope so it names the applied-state proposition as claim C3's, and a fresh execution (a0f10ee024ac4ba38d3b84b21a8b40f3, run 32aff0d098454dc78bec6a3916753fa9) has confirmed the same C1 findings against that amended claim.\\\",\n \\\"artifact_id\\\":\\\"05dc6a3632954371911663108e7e18e8\\\",\n \\\"review_items\\\":[{\n  \\\"aspect\\\":\\\"checker_correspondence\\\",\n  \\\"status\\\":\\\"revision_needed\\\",\n  \\\"source_ids\\\":[\\\"S20-exec\\\",\\\"S23-state-conflict-apply\\\",\\\"S15-handlePrepareReply\\\",\\\"S14-recovery-start-prepare\\\"],\n  \\\"report_title\\\":\\\"被修订声明的旧工件按范围失效\\\",\n  \\\"report_answer\\\":\\\"该工件的三条范围内属性与已复核结论一致，但它断言的应用层一致性在 C1 的义务之外：F2 已把该边界写入 C1 的 scope，并指明应用层一致性属于 C3。因此该工件对 C1 而言已被取代（其基础版本为 v1），不应再用于确认 C1；同一问题的现时结论来自 v2 上的新执行。\\\",\n  \\\"challenged_components\\\":[\\\"scope\\\"],\n  \\\"rationale\\\":\\\"Aspect versus component: the challenged component is the claim's scope, which the accepted F2 has now amended, and the artifact's fixed bytes still assert an out-of-scope predicate, so the artifact remains superseded for basis rather than repaired. The review therefore records the boundary and answers the issue instead of re-judging the three in-scope properties, which the earlier reviews already found sound and which the fresh execution reproduced. The resolution applies to the amended claim version and to artifacts on that basis; it does not legalise this older artifact.\\\",\n  \\\"counterevidence\\\":[\\\"the claim's scope now states that the obligation ends at adopting the reported committed vector and names claim C3 for applied-state agreement, so the artifact's applied-state property is outside C1 by the claim's own words (claim C1 version 2, S20-exec)\\\",\n    \\\"the fresh execution bound to that version reproduces the three in-scope findings (artifact a0f10ee024ac4ba38d3b84b21a8b40f3, run 32aff0d098454dc78bec6a3916753fa9)\\\"],\n  \\\"limitations\\\":[\\\"the artifact keeps its bytes; this review changes attribution and basis, not the artifact\\\",\n    \\\"the applied-state result lives with claim C3 and its own reviewed check\\\"]}],\n \\\"resolutions\\\":[{\n  \\\"issue_id\\\":\\\"ef6b54abce294555b31a3c9a6ca606ac\\\",\n  \\\"source_ids\\\":[\\\"S20-exec\\\",\\\"S15-handlePrepareReply\\\"],\n  \\\"evidence_ids\\\":[\\\"a0f10ee024ac4ba38d3b84b21a8b40f3\\\",\\\"32aff0d098454dc78bec6a3916753fa9\\\"],\n  \\\"rationale\\\":\\\"The issue required either that the applied-state property leave the C1 checker set or that the proposition be fixed as its own obligation, and both hold now: claim C3 owns the proposition with a reviewed check, and C1's scope has been amended (F2 revision on the claim, version 2) to name that boundary explicitly. The artifact's in-scope properties were already reviewed as sound, no C1 result depends on the applied-state property, and the fresh execution on the amended version re-established the C1 findings, so the challenged component is answered on its own terms rather than by re-judging the artifact.\\\",\n  \\\"residual_issue_ids\\\":[],\n  \\\"scope_limitations\\\":[\\\"the older artifact remains superseded for basis and must not be used to confirm C1\\\",\n    \\\"C3's check carries its own limitations (direct execution, one instance and key, prepared records)\\\"]}]}\njson.dump(sub,open('submission-resolve-scope.json','w'),indent=2,ensure_ascii=False)\nprint('written')\nPY\ncd .. && /home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/.venv/bin/python -I -B -c \\\"import sys; sys.path.insert(0, '/home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/src'); from consensus_assurance.cli import main; raise SystemExit(main())\\\" validate --run /home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/runs/2026-10-07_16-54-34-swiftpaxos_epaxos-real-run --submission submission-resolve-scope.json 2>&1 | head -10\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
